  "body": "It's just a 3-minute stroll to Narrow Neck beach from this modern home offering you the perfect blend of relaxed coastal living, privacy and versatility. \r\nYou will love this weatherboard property with a welcoming feel and a layout designed for easy living. At its heart is a light and inviting open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, flowing effortlessly outdoors to a private, peaceful, safely fenced garden – the perfect spot for you to unwind, entertain or simply enjoy the sunshine.\r\nThe accommodation offers exciting possibilities, with three bedrooms in the main house plus a separate one-bedroom bedsit within the property with its own outdoor living space. Upstairs the master retreat has a living room opening to a private balcony and master bedroom with ensuite. \r\nWhether you need space for extended family, teenagers, guests, an income, a work-from-home setup or simply some extra flexibility, the options are plentiful.\r\nTucked away at the end of a driveway, this property enjoys a sense of privacy and peace with beautiful trees and birdlife, while still being moments from the beach for you to enjoy a swim before or after work and school. There's plenty of off-street parking, adding to everyday convenience.\r\nCoastal convenience, flexible living and a peaceful, private setting waiting for you in this sought-after Narrow Neck location.\r\nA home with options, appeal and a lifestyle for you to love!",
